# Azure DevOps personal access token for the azure-devops-boards skill.
#
# Do NOT put the real file in this repository. Copy this file to:
#   ~/.config/azdo/.env        (Windows: C:\Users\<you>\.config\azdo\.env)
# or point AZDO_ENV_FILE at another location outside the repo,
# or set AZDO_PAT as an environment variable instead.
#
# Create the PAT at https://dev.azure.com/<org>/_usersSettings/tokens
# Scope: Work Items -> Read & write. Nothing else is needed.
AZDO_PAT=
